93
00:05:22.073 --> 00:05:27.818
you can use a prompt, which I'm
going to specify here, to ask an

94
00:05:27.818 --> 00:05:31.512
LLM to compare how well the
automatically generated customer

95
00:05:31.512 --> 00:05:33.974
service agent output
corresponds to the

96
00:05:33.974 --> 00:05:36.436
ideal expert response
